      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;LibreOffice is the most powerful and viable Free Softare&#xA; office suite, available cross-platform. As well as a few demos showing its&#xA; joys, we&amp;#39;ll understand the history, and rational behind the LibreOffice&#xA; project and its relation to OpenOffice.org.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
